## Approach
Use a stack to push open brackets and pop matching opening brackets when closing brackets are encountered.

## Algorithm
Stack Data Structure Evaluation

## Code
```typescript
function isValid(s) {
 const stack = [];
 const map = { ')': '(', '}': '{', ']': '[' };
 for (const char of s) {
 if (char in map) {
 if (stack.pop() !== map[char]) return false;
 } else {
 stack.push(char);
 }
 }
 return stack.length === 0;
}
console.log(isValid('()[]{}'));
```

